      "first": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"wp-block-paragraph\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dsm-current-accent-color)\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph has-text-color has-normal-font-size\" style=\"color:var(--sm-current-accent-color);margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">About us</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"wp-block-paragraph\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dsm-current-accent-color)\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph has-text-color has-normal-font-size\" style=\"color:var(--sm-current-accent-color);margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">Athletics was named for our first office: a dusty, un-air-conditioned boxing gym in an earlier, grittier incarnation of Williamsburg. None of us boxed. But it captured our founders’ scrappy entrepreneurialism.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"wp-block-paragraph\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var(\\u002d\\u002dsm-current-accent-color)\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"22px\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph has-text-color has-normal-font-size\" style=\"color:var(--sm-current-accent-color);margin-top:22px;margin-bottom:0\">We’ve since grown to a larger team and a proper office with windows and HVAC. But the spirit of that boxing gym survives: in our work, our collaborative style, and the creative values we fight for every day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
